{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010first In the Ninja kato Series!\u3011</strong></h2>A 2D action game in the style of 1980s handheld games.<br>Control the robot ninja Kato and train him to become a full-fledged ninja.<br><br>There are a total of 4 stages given to Ninja Kato.<br>After clearing all stages, Kato will take on an even more difficult stage.<br><br>When all training is completed, Kato will make new history!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010STAGE 01\u3011</strong></h2>Avoid the &quot;kunai&quot; and Get the Items!<br>The Time Limit Is 650 Seconds!<br>This is an exercise in quick thinking and good judgment.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653330/extras/8f4f581ba549411a1b4ea632e5f9f428.avif?t=1701961681\" width=480 height=270 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010STAGE 02\u3011</strong></h2>Memory Training!<br>Select the buttons in the order of the items displayed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653330/extras/76688eaa0f2a1f73c81c820e2973749e.avif?t=1701961681\" width=480 height=270 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010STAGE 03\u3011</strong></h2>Get Items Using &quot;shuriken&quot;!<br>The Time Limit Is 450 Seconds!<br>Birds Will Get In the Way Of Getting Items!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653330/extras/6eea8cdacb7da9b6ee0b756a6a09dc50.avif?t=1701961681\" width=480 height=270 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010STAGE 04\u3011</strong></h2>Finally, Training With the Master!<br>Avoid the &quot;kunai&quot; fired by your master and get items!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653330/extras/de6414fd264affc0e0bf78d2673b8248.avif?t=1701961681\" width=480 height=270 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u3010EXTRA STAGE\u3011</strong></h2>This is an extra stage with increased difficulty!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653330/extras/75baa096f606e427214595ae089f8aa6.avif?t=1701961681\" width=480 height=270 /></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"STAGE1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2653330/ece6f1e3e1fcabef5776756b2946846cb69eb195.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2653330/ece6f1e3e1fcabef5776756b2946846cb69eb195.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2653330/ece6f1e3e1fcabef5776756b2946846cb69eb195.jpg"},{"name":"STAGE4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2653330/ece6f1e3e1fcabef5776756b2946846cb69eb195.jpg"},{"name":"EXTRA STAGE1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2653330/ece6f1e3e1fcabef5776756b2946846cb69eb195.jpg"},{"name":"EXTRA STAGE2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2653330/ece6f1e3e1fcabef5776756b2946846cb69eb195.jpg"},{"name":"EXTRA STAGE3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2653330/ece6f1e3e1fcabef5776756b2946846cb69eb195.jpg"},{"name":"EXTRA STAGE4","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2653330/ece6f1e3e1fcabef5776756b2946846cb69eb195.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2653330?t=1701961681","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2653330?t=1701961681","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653330/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1701961681","capsule_imagev